            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reviva Half-Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Mesa</strong> é a reimaginação feita por fãs de <strong>Half-Life</strong> da Valve Software.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/90628820dd51e4587eda3a2bcb03f592.poster.avif?t=1790377127\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/90628820dd51e4587eda3a2bcb03f592.webm?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/90628820dd51e4587eda3a2bcb03f592.mp4?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Black Mesa: Definitive Edition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A atualização 1.5 reúne todas as melhorias gráficas e de jogabilidade acumuladas ao longo de 15 anos de desenvolvimento para criar a versão final de Black Mesa. Nunca houve melhor altura para pegar no pé de cabra e jogar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/f7bb2433b064b6114d6ff7e5c0ebac8f.poster.avif?t=1790377127\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/f7bb2433b064b6114d6ff7e5c0ebac8f.webm?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/f7bb2433b064b6114d6ff7e5c0ebac8f.mp4?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campanha para um jogador</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tu és Gordon Freeman, um físico teórico no Complexo de Investigação de Black Mesa. Quando uma experiência de rotina corre terrivelmente mal, é preciso lutar contra uma invasão alienígena interdimensional e uma equipa de limpeza militar sedenta de sangue para salvar a equipa científica... e o mundo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/7dee67b045715757faad82e4dc58f618.poster.avif?t=1790377127\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/7dee67b045715757faad82e4dc58f618.webm?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/7dee67b045715757faad82e4dc58f618.mp4?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recursos</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uma campanha para um jogador completamente reimaginada e melhorada, incluindo níveis Xen totalmente novos e expandidos</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 capítulos de combate em laboratórios ultrassecretos, corridas em paisagens desérticas inóspitas, infiltrações em caminhos-de-ferro abandonados e saltos entre dimensões</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gráficos e efeitos impressionantes, nunca antes vistos no Source Engine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enfrente um exército de inimigos clássicos, atualizados com novas funcionalidades e IA envolvente</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empunhe um arsenal de equipamento militar, protótipos científicos e o icónico pé-de-cabra em ambientes incrivelmente detalhados</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A banda sonora e a dobragem totalmente novas criam uma experiência mais imersiva do que nunca</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 conquistas divertidas e desafiantes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/36d548f31f44f6236b3e8119fbd61cbd.poster.avif?t=1790377127\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/36d548f31f44f6236b3e8119fbd61cbd.webm?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/36d548f31f44f6236b3e8119fbd61cbd.mp4?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multijogador</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elimine os seus amigos em <strong>10</strong> mapas icónicos do universo Half-Life, incluindo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gasworks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stalkyard</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undertow</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossfire</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/d87a23bfd4f049212d02cd04872fb6ff.poster.avif?t=1790377127\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/d87a23bfd4f049212d02cd04872fb6ff.webm?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/d87a23bfd4f049212d02cd04872fb6ff.mp4?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oficina</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crie os seus próprios mods, modelos e mapas com o SDK <strong>Black Mesa</strong> Source e partilhe-os com a comunidade na Oficina Steam. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/9f5d8467e202c3380cd66c4f512780fa.poster.avif?t=1790377127\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/9f5d8467e202c3380cd66c4f512780fa.webm?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/9f5d8467e202c3380cd66c4f512780fa.mp4?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steamworks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coleciona o conjunto completo de cartas colecionáveis, fundos, emoticons e conquistas! Com Steam Cloud, Oficina Steam, legendas em vários idiomas e suporte completo para comandos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/59292798d6ade740010962695e7d0dba.poster.avif?t=1790377127\" width=610 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/59292798d6ade740010962695e7d0dba.webm?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/362890/extras/59292798d6ade740010962695e7d0dba.mp4?t=1790377127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Encontrou um erro de tradução? Por favor, reporte-o na secção de Discussões.</i></p>",
